{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>A journey of three days.</b> A three-day journey they traveled in one day, for the Holy One, blessed be He, was eager to bring them into the land immediately (Sifrei)." "<b>And the Ark of the Covenant of YHWH traveled before them a journey of three days.</b> This is the Ark that went out with them to war, in which the broken tablets were placed. It went ahead of them a journey of three days, to prepare for them a place to encamp (ibid.; Jerusalem Talmud Shekalim 6)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:13.138790063Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}